{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-sdk-overview","title":"AI SDK 6 概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/foundations/ai-sdk-overview","wordCount":1322,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"ai-sdk-6-概览\">AI SDK 6 概览</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>AI SDK 是 TypeScript 生态里把「模型 API 差异」抽象掉的一层框架。直接调用各厂商 HTTP API 时，流式解析、工具调用拼装、多轮循环都要自己写；AI SDK 把这些共性问题收敛为统一的 Core API，让应用代码只依赖 <code>LanguageModel</code> 这一抽象，而不是某个厂商的请求格式。</p>\n<p>它的设计遵循分层：Core 定义与模型无关的能力（generateText / streamText / generateObject / Agent 循环），Provider 把各厂商 API 适配为统一接口，UI 层再把 Core 的流式结果接进 React、Svelte 等框架。换模型只需替换 Provider 实例，上层代码零改动。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>包名</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Core</td>\n<td><code>ai</code></td>\n<td>generateText、streamText、工具调用、Agent 循环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Provider</td>\n<td><code>@ai-sdk/openai</code> 等</td>\n<td>将不同模型 API 适配为统一接口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI (React)</td>\n<td><code>@ai-sdk/react</code></td>\n<td>useChat 等 Hook</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI (Svelte)</td>\n<td><code>@ai-sdk/svelte</code></td>\n<td>Svelte 框架集成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本手册统一基于 v6 撰写，示例形态同样适用于 v5+。理解这套分层，是后续所有章节的前提——凡是涉及「换模型」「加工具」「控循环」的能力，最终都落在这些层次中的某一层。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"为什么选择-ai-sdk\">为什么选择 AI SDK</h2><p>Vercel AI SDK 是一个面向 TypeScript 生态的 AI 应用框架，它将不同模型提供商的 API 抽象为统一接口，同时提供流式处理、工具调用、Agent 循环等开箱即用的能力。SDK 在 v5 完成了一次重大架构升级——引入 UIMessage/ModelMessage 双消息模型、Provider 规范化（<code>LanguageModel</code> 接口）和 <code>stopWhen</code> 声明式循环控制，v6 在此基础上继续演进。本手册统一基于 v6 撰写，示例 API 形态同样适用于 v5+。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 应用层&#10;        APP[你的应用代码]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph AI SDK Core&#10;        GEN[generateText]&#10;        STREAM[streamText]&#10;        OBJ[generateObject]&#10;        AGENT[Agent Loop]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Provider 层&#10;        OPENAI[&quot;@ai-sdk/openai&quot;]&#10;        ANTHROPIC[&quot;@ai-sdk/anthropic&quot;]&#10;        GOOGLE[&quot;@ai-sdk/google&quot;]&#10;        CUSTOM[&quot;自定义 Provider&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 模型 API&#10;        GPT[&quot;OpenAI API&quot;]&#10;        CLAUDE[&quot;Anthropic API&quot;]&#10;        GEMINI[&quot;Google API&quot;]&#10;        LOCAL[&quot;本地模型&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    APP --&gt; GEN&#10;    APP --&gt; STREAM&#10;    APP --&gt; OBJ&#10;    APP --&gt; AGENT&#10;    GEN --&gt; OPENAI&#10;    GEN --&gt; ANTHROPIC&#10;    STREAM --&gt; GOOGLE&#10;    AGENT --&gt; CUSTOM&#10;    OPENAI --&gt; GPT&#10;    ANTHROPIC --&gt; CLAUDE&#10;    GOOGLE --&gt; GEMINI&#10;    CUSTOM --&gt; LOCAL\">graph TB\n    subgraph 应用层\n        APP[你的应用代码]\n    end\n    subgraph AI SDK Core\n        GEN[generateText]\n        STREAM[streamText]\n        OBJ[generateObject]\n        AGENT[Agent Loop]\n    end\n    subgraph Provider 层\n        OPENAI[\"@ai-sdk/openai\"]\n        ANTHROPIC[\"@ai-sdk/anthropic\"]\n        GOOGLE[\"@ai-sdk/google\"]\n        CUSTOM[\"自定义 Provider\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 模型 API\n        GPT[\"OpenAI API\"]\n        CLAUDE[\"Anthropic API\"]\n        GEMINI[\"Google API\"]\n        LOCAL[\"本地模型\"]\n    end\n    APP --&gt; GEN\n    APP --&gt; STREAM\n    APP --&gt; OBJ\n    APP --&gt; AGENT\n    GEN --&gt; OPENAI\n    GEN --&gt; ANTHROPIC\n    STREAM --&gt; GOOGLE\n    AGENT --&gt; CUSTOM\n    OPENAI --&gt; GPT\n    ANTHROPIC --&gt; CLAUDE\n    GOOGLE --&gt; GEMINI\n    CUSTOM --&gt; LOCAL</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心模块\">核心模块</h2><p>AI SDK 分为三个层次：Core（核心 API）、Provider（模型适配）、UI（前端集成）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模块</th>\n<th>包名</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Core</td>\n<td><code>ai</code></td>\n<td>generateText、streamText、工具调用、Agent 循环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Provider</td>\n<td><code>@ai-sdk/openai</code> 等</td>\n<td>将不同模型 API 适配为统一接口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI (React)</td>\n<td><code>@ai-sdk/react</code></td>\n<td>useChat 等 Hook</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI (Svelte)</td>\n<td><code>@ai-sdk/svelte</code></td>\n<td>Svelte 框架集成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心-api\">核心 API</h2><h3 id=\"generatetext\">generateText</h3><p>一次性生成完整文本，适用于后端处理、批量任务等不需要流式输出的场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { generateText } from &#39;ai&#39;;&#10;import { openai } from &#39;@ai-sdk/openai&#39;;&#10;&#10;const { text, usage, finishReason } = await generateText({&#10;  model: openai(&#39;gpt-5&#39;),&#10;  system: &#39;你是一个专业的技术助手。&#39;,&#10;  prompt: &#39;用一句话解释什么是 Agent。&#39;,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { generateText } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { openai } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@ai-sdk/openai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">usage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">finishReason</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  model: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openai</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  system: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'你是一个专业的技术助手。'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prompt: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'用一句话解释什么是 Agent。'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"streamtext\">streamText</h3><p>流式生成文本，逐 token 输出，适用于聊天界面的实时响应：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { streamText } from &#39;ai&#39;;&#10;import { openai } from &#39;@ai-sdk/openai&#39;;&#10;&#10;const result = streamText({&#10;  model: openai(&#39;gpt-5&#39;),&#10;  messages: [{ role: &#39;user&#39;, content: &#39;写一首关于编程的诗&#39; }],&#10;});&#10;&#10;for await (const chunk of result.textStream) {&#10;  process.stdout.write(chunk);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { streamText } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { openai } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@ai-sdk/openai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> streamText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  model: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openai</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  messages: [{ role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, content: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'写一首关于编程的诗'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> chunk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.textStream) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  process.stdout.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(chunk);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"generateobject\">generateObject</h3><p>让模型输出结构化数据，通过 Zod Schema 约束输出格式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { generateObject } from &#39;ai&#39;;&#10;import { openai } from &#39;@ai-sdk/openai&#39;;&#10;import { z } from &#39;zod&#39;;&#10;&#10;const { object } = await generateObject({&#10;  model: openai(&#39;gpt-5&#39;),&#10;  schema: z.object({&#10;    name: z.string(),&#10;    description: z.string(),&#10;    difficulty: z.enum([&#39;easy&#39;, &#39;medium&#39;, &#39;hard&#39;]),&#10;  }),&#10;  prompt: &#39;生成一个 TypeScript 编程练习题。&#39;,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { generateObject } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { openai } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@ai-sdk/openai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { z } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'zod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateObject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  model: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openai</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  schema: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    description: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    difficulty: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'easy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hard'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prompt: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'生成一个 TypeScript 编程练习题。'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"工具调用\">工具调用</h2><p>AI SDK 通过 <code>tool()</code> 函数定义工具，模型可以在对话中主动调用这些工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { generateText, tool, stepCountIs } from &#39;ai&#39;;&#10;import { openai } from &#39;@ai-sdk/openai&#39;;&#10;import { z } from &#39;zod&#39;;&#10;&#10;const { text } = await generateText({&#10;  model: openai(&#39;gpt-5&#39;),&#10;  tools: {&#10;    getWeather: tool({&#10;      description: &#39;获取指定城市的天气&#39;,&#10;      inputSchema: z.object({&#10;        city: z.string().describe(&#39;城市名称&#39;),&#10;      }),&#10;      execute: async ({ city }) =&gt; {&#10;        return { city, temperature: 22, condition: &#39;晴&#39; };&#10;      },&#10;    }),&#10;  },&#10;  stopWhen: stepCountIs(5),&#10;  prompt: &#39;北京今天天气怎么样？&#39;,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { generateText, tool, stepCountIs } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { openai } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@ai-sdk/openai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { z } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'zod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  model: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openai</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;